SUMMARY:Becoming Independent Talent Show at The Backdrop
DESCRIPTION:Becoming Independent's Talent Show brings 20 performers to The Backdrop in Santa Rosa for a joyful morning of music\, dance\, comedy\, and storytelling. The acts come from Becoming Independent's programs\, and the warm room is built around community cheering and shared creativity.  Friday\, April 24\, 2026 from 11:00am to 12:30pm. Free admission.      Event Tickets  Visit Website  
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/becoming-independent-talent-show-at-the-backdrop/
LOCATION:1455 Corporate Center Pkwy, Santa Rosa, CA, 95407, United States
