SUMMARY:Elevated Sessions: at The Lounge at Mercy
DESCRIPTION:Step into a higher class of cannabis. Elevated Sessions is an intimate\, sommelier-led tasting experience featuring CAM premium indoor flower\, curated for the true cannabis connoisseur.Join us for a refined 60-minute session designed to awaken the senses. Your cannabis sommelier will guide you through 4 exceptional cultivars—exploring their terpene profiles\, aromas\, flavors\, and effects—while you savor a drink from the natural soda bar\, curated snacks\, and palate cleansers.This is more than a tasting—it's an immersive journey through craft cannabis\, where every detail is designed to elevate your evening\, from the intimate atmosphere to the exclusive perks awaiting guests.Date &amp; Sessions: Friday\, April 24\, 2026 | Two sessions: 6:00 PM and 8:00 PMCapacity: 16 guests per sessionWhat's Included: Natural Soda\, Guided Tasting of 4 Curated Strains\, Tasting Passport\, Charcuterie &amp; Palate Cleansers\, Meet The Grower\, Exclusive PerksTickets: $75 per session | 21+ Only | DCC # C12-0000420-LIC
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/elevated-sessions-at-the-lounge-at-mercy-3/
LOCATION:7950 Redwood Drive, Cotati, CA, 94931
CATEGORIES:Drink,Experiences,Food,Other,Sonoma County
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://winecountry-media.s3.amazonaws.com/wp-content/uploads/sites/5/2026/04/21222931/Elevated-Sessions-February-500-x-500-Sesh-in-Action-1-1.jpg
END:VEVENT
