SUMMARY:Pressed Flower Workshop at Benziger Family Winery
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate Earth Day at Benziger Family Winery with a hands-on Pressed Flower Workshop hosted by Chris Benziger and Cloverdale Creative. Guests will learn expert techniques for creating beautiful pressed flower art\, using unlimited florals and provided materials. Each participant receives a glass hanging frame\, all necessary tools\, and a glass of Running Wild Chardonnay to sip while crafting. Additional wine is available for purchase by the glass or bottle. This immersive workshop blends creativity\, sustainability\, and wine\, offering a relaxing and inspiring way to honor Earth Day. RSVP by April 11th. 
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/pressed-flower-workshop-at-benziger-family-winery/
LOCATION:1883 London Ranch Road, Glen Ellen, CA, 95442, United States
GEO:-122.5418777;38.3605875
CATEGORIES:Celebration,Crafts,Drink,Educational,Sonoma County,Wine
