SUMMARY:Perfect People Party at Convene by Dan Kosta
DESCRIPTION:Celebrate good times and great company at Convene by Dan Kosta Wine Lounge during the Perfect People Party\, inspired by a beloved family tradition of honoring April birthdays. This lively gathering pays tribute to the team’s April-born members with a festive afternoon on the patio.    Guests can enjoy wood-fired pizza\, Dan Kosta’s renowned Pinot Noir\, and a welcoming\, celebratory atmosphere. Whether you’re celebrating your own April birthday or simply love a great party\, everyone is invited to raise a glass and join the fun.    Come toast to another trip around the sun with friends and exceptional wine.
URL:https://www.sonoma.com/event/perfect-people-party-at-convene-by-dan-kosta-wine-lounge/
LOCATION:14210 Bacchus Lndg Way #300 , Healdsburg, CA, 95448, United States
